AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"38.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"4.799999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,94.0 14.2,95.3 19.3,92.9 24.5,91.8 29.6,90.2 34.7,90.9 39.8,86.6 44.9,80.2 50.0,77.0 55.1,78.5 60.3,78.1 65.4,76.8 70.5,76.4 75.6,72.7 80.7,69.0 85.8,66.4 91.0,68.3 96.1,66.8 101.2,60.4 106.3,45.3 111.4,54.3 116.5,54.0 121.6,53.9 126.8,62.3 131.9,59.5 137.0,59.2 142.1,58.4 147.2,49.9 152.3,46.6 157.4,47.9 162.6,47.1 167.7,54.7 172.8,51.3 177.9,51.2 183.0,41.7 188.1,38.7 193.2,39.4 198.4,36.5 203.5,38.2 208.6,34.1 213.7,36.7 218.8,39.3 223.9,36.4 229.0,27.6 234.2,30.9 239.3,26.5 244.4,21.8 249.5,23.4 254.6,29.3 259.7,31.8 264.9,20.7 270.0,26.2 275.1,21.3 280.2,19.8 285.3,21.6 290.4,17.2 295.5,18.0 300.7,15.8 305.8,12.8 310.9,21.6 316.0,28.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 203.5 50.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 218.8 51.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 239.3 38.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"28.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#